        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Gate 2 — the output uses explicit categories, dimensions, distinctions or assignment principles to classify phenomena."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 2
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1904
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/codeWhen/003",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Gate 3 — the classification is materially developed."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 3
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1905
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/doNotCodeWhen/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Do not infer a contribution claim solely from the existence of a corresponding artifact, method, section, or recommendation."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1908
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/doNotCodeWhen/002",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Generic usefulness, ordinary synthesis, incidental outputs, and routine implications are insufficient."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 2
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1909
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/doNotCodeWhen/003",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "If the authors make no principal contribution claim of this type, code 0 even when related content is present."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 3
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1910
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/negativeExample/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A related element appears in the paper, but it is not explicitly claimed as a principal taxonomy contribution."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1919
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/claimsContributionType.TaxonomyContribution/positiveExample/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The abstract or contribution statement explicitly presents a taxonomy contribution as a principal contribution and the paper materially realizes it."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1916
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/boundaryNote/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Passive software/tool use is insufficient."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1859
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/boundaryNote/002",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Distinguish from HybridHumanMachine by whether substantive human judgment is concurrent/interdependent within the same task."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 2
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1860
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/codeWhen/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A substantive review task at a specified workflow stage is executed by software/algorithmic automation without concurrent substantive human judgment in that execution step."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1852
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/doNotCodeWhen/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Do not code passive database/search/reference-management software."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1855
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/doNotCodeWhen/002",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Do not use when human and machine make integrated substantive decisions within the same task; use HybridHumanMachine."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 2
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1856
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/negativeExample/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The publication has evidence of automated agent only by inference from authorship or generic software use, not an explicit stage-qualified workflow description."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1866
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.AutomatedAgent/positiveExample/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The methods explicitly state that a automated agent configuration performed a specified workflow stage, and the stage is recorded."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1863
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.HybridHumanMachine/boundaryNote/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Separate human and automated stages should be represented separately rather than forced into hybrid."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1881
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.HybridHumanMachine/boundaryNote/002",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Require substantive interdependence, not software-assisted administration."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 2
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/sourceLine": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1882
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/revmeta/guidance/hasAgentConfiguration.HybridHumanMachine/codeWhen/001",
    "@type": [
      "https://w3id.org/revmeta/CodingGuidanceItem"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "At a specified workflow stage, human and automated/AI components make substantively interdependent contributions to the same task."
      }
    ],
    "https://w3id.org/revmeta/itemIndex": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 1
