      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Practice is a recurring professional/organizational/clinical/engineering way of working. If the object is a deliberately delivered intervention/programme with defined components/timing, prefer InterventionOrProgramme unless practice itself is independently analyzed."
      }
    ],
